cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SCARLET in your work, please cite the software as below.
  A paper is in preparation; this file will point to it when it is published.
type: software
title: "SCARLET: reliable and interpretable cell-type annotation for single-cell RNA-seq"
abstract: >-
  SCARLET annotates single-cell RNA-seq data from a labelled reference: it learns each
  identity's marker programme and a background, assigns new cells with explicit refusals
  (background, ambiguity), and transfers labels between technologies with depth matching.
